{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">鄧梓峰近日於社交平台發文，分享與子女前往高爾夫球場打球、享受天倫之樂的溫馨點滴。他在帖文中興奮留言寫道：「今日同仔女去Northview Golf Club 打Canal course, 竟然畀我女兒打咗隻Eagle, 佢話一定要喺支旗擺個pose! 」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"cb7af5c6-e379-4a05-9d46-f6a2f33aa6b1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20262coiLyLMxN1791452988.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"cb7af5c6-e379-4a05-9d46-f6a2f33aa6b1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">從鄧梓峰上載的照片可見，女兒鄧瓊芝（Natalie）高興地站在球洞與旗杆旁邊擺 Pose 打卡。身穿運動造型的她大方展示逆天長腿。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"951c5533-f4a6-41fb-bc2c-af4414945e35.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026vneKi8LlkS1791452988.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"951c5533-f4a6-41fb-bc2c-af4414945e35.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\">現年28歲的鄧瓊芝擁有「九頭身」完美名模身材比例，同時也是一名名副其實的學霸，畢業於美國波士頓大學。受爸爸鄧梓峰的薰陶，鄧瓊芝在藝術與音樂方面極具天分，除了擔任攝影師，更精通鋼琴，過往曾與友人組成樂隊「The Unbroken」，近年亦踩入 DJ 界發展，可謂才貌兼備。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T10:38:52.854980+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}